From d3ec5390d24939a64017b05c3d2557795e55e491 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virtualAxe <virtualaxe@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 12:37:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] virtual gamma: add qemu firmware foundation

Why: add the QEMU firmware foundation required to boot a virtual Bitaxe Gamma
with OpenETH networking, virtual ASIC entry points, virtual peripherals, and
system API metadata.
Virtual-only: selected by CONFIG_BITAXE_VIRTUAL while physical ASIC and board
paths keep their upstream behavior.
Upstream surface: ASIC dispatch, connection setup, Kconfig, HTTP system info,
main task startup, power, thermal, and hashrate reporting.
Verify: run make build, python3 scripts/virtualaxe.py verify-test-ci --source
bitaxe --json, and make verify-submit-replay.
Removal impact: the virtual Gamma profile cannot boot or expose the
ESP-Miner-compatible virtual hardware/API path.

